{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/w-residences-taraf-al-maryah-island","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":51,"crm_id":"91","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"W Residences","slug":"w-residences-taraf-al-maryah-island","display_address":"Al Maryah Island","building_type":["apartment","branded","duplex","penthouse"],"completion_year":"2027","developer":"Taraf","price":2200000,"display_price":"2.2M","lattitude":24.5014264,"longitude":54.390191,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":5,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-taraf/\">Taraf Holding</a>, in partnership with Marriott International, introduces W Residences at Al Maryah Island—a premier branded project offering exclusive <strong>1 to 4-bedroom apartments, 4-bedroom duplexes, and 5-bedroom penthouses.</strong> This striking 37-storey tower combines the signature style of W Hotels with modern luxury, featuring 177 limited residences that provide sweeping views of the island and city skyline. The location offers unmatched connectivity to the heart of Abu Dhabi’s business district, ideal for professionals and families seeking a dynamic yet peaceful lifestyle. Inspired by the graceful lines of traditional dhow boats, the architecture blends heritage with contemporary design.<br><br>The interiors provide a seamless balance of luxury and functionality, reflecting a sophisticated and vibrant way of life. With direct access to fine dining, shopping, and entertainment, residents enjoy the city's excitement and the calm of their waterfront homes. The development fosters community and well-being with social hubs, wellness centers, and exclusive Marriott Bonvoy benefits. Personalized services, including private air travel and in-home spa treatments, elevate the living experience, offering a truly exceptional lifestyle.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_002c4f6459.jpg","hash":"W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_002c4f6459","name":"W Residences by Taraf at Al Maryah Island"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_0eed684f86.jpg","hash":"W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_0eed684f86","name":"W Residences by Taraf at Al Maryah Island"},"media_images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_40f8265451.jpg","hash":"W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_40f8265451","name":"W Residences by Taraf at Al Maryah Island"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_328abba516.jpg","hash":"W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_328abba516","name":"W Residences by Taraf at Al Maryah Island"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_df49305f9e.jpg","hash":"W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_df49305f9e","name":"W Residences by Taraf at Al Maryah Island"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_54355a48a0.jpg","hash":"W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_54355a48a0","name":"W Residences by Taraf at Al Maryah Island"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_1a33d77bca.jpg","hash":"W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_1a33d77bca","name":"W Residences by Taraf at Al Maryah Island"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_c8797c6655.jpg","hash":"W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_c8797c6655","name":"W Residences by Taraf at Al Mar