orld-class healthcare and cultural and leisure spots like Rosewood Abu Dhabi and Beach Rotana Hotel.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1413,"cta":{"id":2190,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_4324c07420.jpg","hash":"W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_4324c07420","name":"W Residences by Taraf at Al Maryah Island"},"style":null,"title":"Unbeatable Location, Unmatched Convenience: Live at the Heart of Al Maryah Island","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>W Residences, a distinguished branded project, enjoys an enviable location at Al Maryah Island, one of Abu Dhabi's most prestigious waterfront destinations. Situated next to the iconic Galleria Mall, residents have exclusive access through a private corridor for effortless shopping, dining, and entertainment. The development is also steps away from the Cleveland Clinic Abu Dhabi, offering world-class healthcare while ensuring easy connectivity to major highways and cultural landmarks, all while preserving the tranquility of island living.</p><ul><li>2 Minutes to The Galleria Al Maryah</li><li>5 Minutes to Abu Dhabi Mall</li><li>5 Minutes to Al Reem Island</li><li>5 Minutes to Al Maryah Sports Centre</li><li>5 Minutes to Beach Rotana Hotel</li><li>7 Minutes to Rosewood Abu Dhabi</li><li>9 Minutes to Cleveland Clinic Abu Dhabi</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3785,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Brochure_406d0c3be5.pdf","hash":"Brochure_406d0c3be5","name":"Brochure"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},