Al Maryah Island a branded project?"},{"id":5733,"answer":"<p>The residences at W Residences are designed to balance luxury and functionality. Offering one—to four-bedroom apartments, each home features high-end finishes, modern layouts, and stunning views of Al Maryah Island and Abu Dhabi's skyline. These homes are tailored to the needs of residents who seek both comfort and style.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What are the key features of the apartments at W Residences?"},{"id":5734,"answer":"<p>W Residences enjoys a strategic location at Al Maryah Island, offering exclusive access to the Galleria Mall for retail, dining, and entertainment. The development is also near Cleveland Clinic Abu Dhabi, providing world-class healthcare. It is well-connected to key areas of Abu Dhabi, offering both privacy and convenience.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"How is the location of W Residences beneficial for residents?"},{"id":5735,"answer":"<p>Residents enjoy access to various personalized services, including Marriott Bonvoy membership, offering exclusive perks like private air travel arrangements and in-home spa treatments. Additionally, the development provides concierge services to ensure a high-quality lifestyle experience.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What exclusive services are available to residents of W Residences?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":null,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_29a5fbc859.jpg","src_cftle":"i/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_29a5fbc859.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1392x/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_29a5fbc859.webp","format":"webp","transform":"1392x","created_at":"2025-03-17 10:44:27.723","updated_at":"2025-03-17 10:50:22.330"},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/340x/W_Residences_by_Taraf_at_Al_Maryah_Island_29a5fbc859.webp","form